  "id": "florida-one",
  "airline": "SWA",
  "name": "Florida One (Florida flag)",
  "kind": "special",
  "description": "Fuselage: white, with the Florida flag's seal laid huge over the mid-fuselage: a gold ring lettered 'GREAT SEAL OF THE STATE OF FLORIDA' in dark red serif capitals from crown to belly, inside it a painted scene (a Seminole woman in a blue dress strewing flowers, a sabal palm, a steamboat, the rising sun's rays over pale sky, green shore and blue water, red-and-white hibiscus); red wedges of the flag's saltire running from the ring to the crown and belly, fore and aft. Cheatlines: none. Tail: Heart fin with white 'Southwest'. Engines: green and orange with the mural's flowers. Winglets: gray. Titles: 'Southwest' white on the lower fin; 'Florida One' small by the cockpit. Artwork: Florida seal. Colors hex: matched by eye from photos.",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "drawnOn": "B737",
